COMMENT ON TABLE "public"."data_catalogue" IS 'Datasets published by government agencies on state open-data portals. Records ABOUT data, not the data. Ingested from CKAN APIs; see src/lib/data-sources/ckan.ts. A row makes no claim about what its figures say.';



COMMENT ON COLUMN "public"."data_catalogue"."jurisdiction" IS 'Whose data it is, where that can be established from the publisher. NULL when unknown. NOT the portal it was found on: data.sa.gov.au federates other states.';



COMMENT ON COLUMN "public"."data_catalogue"."last_modified_at" IS 'When the PUBLISHER last changed it. Distinct from last_seen_at, which is when we last looked.';



COMMENT ON COLUMN "public"."data_catalogue"."category" IS 'Mirrors the platform layer model. uncategorised is deliberate, never a fallback guess.';



COMMENT ON COLUMN "public"."data_catalogue"."source_portal" IS 'The open-data portal the record was harvested from. An observation, not a claim about ownership.';



