COMMENT ON COLUMN "public"."justice_matrix_cases"."verified" IS 'THE SOURCE LINK RESOLVED. NOT a human review. Ben decided on 2026-08-21 (#423) that "verified" means a named person checked the fields; by that definition this column establishes nothing, and no surface may render it as "source checked" or "verified". The reader is src/lib/justice-matrix/trust-state.ts, which maps a true here to `link-checked`. A human credential comes ONLY from case_attestations, which held zero rows on the day this was written. Guard: src/__tests__/lib/verified-vocabulary.test.ts';



COMMENT ON COLUMN "public"."justice_matrix_cases"."verified_by" IS 'FREE TEXT FROM A REQUEST BODY. NEVER a credential. 17 rows read "curated-seed (link-verified)", which rendered to lawyers as a credential until 2026-08-19. A reviewer is recorded in case_attestations, which carries a name, a date, a scope and a withdrawal. Never gate trust on this column.';



COMMENT ON COLUMN "public"."justice_matrix_cases"."lat" IS 'Latitude for map visualization';



COMMENT ON COLUMN "public"."justice_matrix_cases"."lng" IS 'Longitude for map visualization';



COMMENT ON COLUMN "public"."justice_matrix_cases"."country_code" IS 'ISO 3166 country code';



COMMENT ON COLUMN "public"."justice_matrix_cases"."categories" IS 'Legal categories (non-refoulement, detention, etc.)';



COMMENT ON COLUMN "public"."justice_matrix_cases"."outcome" IS 'Case outcome: favorable, adverse, or pending';



COMMENT ON COLUMN "public"."justice_matrix_cases"."precedent_strength" IS 'Importance for future cases: high, medium, low';



COMMENT ON COLUMN "public"."justice_matrix_cases"."featured" IS 'Highlighted for storytelling';



COMMENT ON COLUMN "public"."justice_matrix_cases"."featured_at" IS 'When item was featured';



COMMENT ON COLUMN "public"."justice_matrix_cases"."human_confirmed" IS 'A BARE BOOLEAN WITH NOBODY BEHIND IT. Zero rows carry it as at 2026-08-21, and the reader no longer promotes it: `human` requires a live case_attestations row. Same defect shape as alma_interventions.reviewed_by, which is NULL on all 14 rows marked human_verified.';



COMMENT ON COLUMN "public"."justice_matrix_cases"."ai_extracted_at" IS 'Timestamp of the most recent machine extraction (auto-publish insert or deep-field backfill). Provenance only — does not imply human confirmation.';



