COMMENT ON COLUMN "public"."organization_claims"."user_id" IS 'Null means the claimant had no account when they applied -- the anonymous doors at /api/communities/claim and /api/basecamps/apply. Approval mints an invite and the account is created then. NOT NULL until 2026-08-20, which meant both of those doors failed on every request.';



COMMENT ON COLUMN "public"."organization_claims"."consent_level" IS 'How the org wants its data treated on the Map. Maps to alma_interventions.consent_level for any intervention they operate.';



COMMENT ON COLUMN "public"."organization_claims"."permitted_uses" IS 'Which surfaces the org is happy to appear on. Toggle keys: display_on_map, link_to_website, link_to_stories, included_in_funder_packs, contactable_by_judges, contactable_by_other_orgs.';



COMMENT ON COLUMN "public"."organization_claims"."reversibility_until" IS '14-day grace window during which the org can revise their consent settings before the Map reflects the change publicly.';



