COMMENT ON TABLE "public"."record_grants" IS 'Capability grants for the correction door. The token IS the authority; it is delivered out of band and NEVER returned by any endpoint. RLS is on with zero policies deliberately: only the service role reads this, because a SELECT would hand out every capability at once.';



COMMENT ON COLUMN "public"."record_grants"."redeemed_at" IS 'First use. Not a lock: a person may correct their record more than once. It records that the token reached a human, which is the only signal we have that the out-of-band delivery worked.';



